{"duration": 43.191, "exact_word_timing": true, "lines": [{"beat": 0, "text": "Mary brandished a kitchen fork like a sword, refusing anyone entry.", "start": 0.05, "end": 3.421}, {"beat": 1, "text": "Neighbors laughed, calling her a stubborn cook who feared losing work.", "start": 3.621, "end": 6.521}, {"beat": 1, "text": "They dismissed the doctor's warnings as mere gossip.", "start": 6.601, "end": 8.841}, {"beat": 2, "text": "Police dragged her to Willard Parker Hospital.", "start": 9.041, "end": 11.195}, {"beat": 2, "text": "Scientists tested her stool three times each week.", "start": 11.275, "end": 13.451}, {"beat": 2, "text": "The bacteria hid in her gallbladder, impossible to cure.", "start": 13.531, "end": 16.155}, {"beat": 3, "text": "You see, it\u2019s like a broken spoon.", "start": 16.355, "end": 17.977}, {"beat": 3, "text": "It keeps poisoning every bowl of soup.", "start": 18.057, "end": 19.763}, {"beat": 4, "text": "She kept cooking, spreading typhoid to dozens and causing three deaths.", "start": 19.963, "end": 23.128}, {"beat": 4, "text": "The city locked her on North Brother Island to stop more outbreaks.", "start": 23.208, "end": 26.098}, {"beat": 5, "text": "Other carriers were released, given jobs, and paid rent.", "start": 26.298, "end": 29.007}, {"beat": 5, "text": "Mary alone stayed thirty\u2011six years.", "start": 29.087, "end": 30.75}, {"beat": 5, "text": "She became a scapegoat because she was a woman cook.", "start": 30.83, "end": 32.963}, {"beat": 6, "text": "When she tried to work again in 1914, another outbreak erupted.", "start": 33.163, "end": 36.477}, {"beat": 6, "text": "Investigators matched her handwriting and sent her back to the island.", "start": 36.557, "end": 39.629}, {"beat": 6, "text": "She spent the rest of her life baking cakes for fellow patients.", "start": 39.709, "end": 42.291}], "words": [{"w": "Mary", "start": 0.144, "end": 0.369, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "brandished", "start": 0.419, "end": 0.694, "line": 0, 